      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just easy for someone to say. what's the point of \"starting new\" when the person I used to be is dead? the person everyone respected, the person who actually mattered... that guy is gone. i feel like i'm just dragging this heavy, broken shell around, and it's exhausting. sometimes i just think it would be easier if everything just stopped. if the silence was permanent.",
